From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:13:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: Add the ASUS Vivobook S14 and S16
 S5408QA and S5608QA

Add the ASUS Vivobook S14 S5408QA, S14 Flip TP5408QA, S16 S5608QA and
S16 Flip TP5608QA with the Snapdragon X X1-26-100 and X1-26-101. Their
DSDTs in ASUS's BIOS updates differ only in the model string, and their
power tables match the Zenbook 14 UX3480QA's, so one board file on its
tree serves all four: keyboard on i2c22, touchpad, EC HID, lid, Wi-Fi,
NVMe, and the touchscreen on i2c8 on the Flips.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
