 .../x126100-asus-vivobook-s14-s5408qa.dts     | 39 +++++++++
 ...126100-asus-vivobook-s16-flip-tp5608qa.dts | 83 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../x126100-asus-vivobook-s16-s5608qa.dts     | 39 +++++++++
 .../dts/qcom/x126100-asus-vivobook-s5x08.dtsi | 84 +++++++++++++++++++
